# LEARNER C, LOCAL, TOWN01, ACTION REPEAT 2, ON THE DEBiT-BASED TRUNK, WITH THE IQL WARM-UP DONE SAFELY
# (user 2026-11-14, after the k=8 control-stream run scored 0/80: "remove action repeat reduce to 2",
# "lets try with debit encoder").
# = slurm/local_frl_c0emb_t01_ar2_xp.env -- the last local arm that worked: c0's frozen trunk, which hands
#   the learner [c0 GRU state | DEBiT binocular features]; action repeat 2; c0's expert rows PINNED
#   (c0_m1_t01t05_k2.npz, 94,947 rows) -- with:
#   1. GOAL_ARRIVAL_MAX_SPEED=10: the slow-arrival rule (user 2026-11-13); scored with
#      slurm/il_eval_val_chw_jr_strict1m_ar2.env;
#   2. FRL_IQL_PRETRAIN=30000: IQL (FastRLAP's rules) on the pinned rows, on the learner's own critic and
#      actor, before the first env step (user 2026-11-14: "also pretrain critic with IQL first"), with the
#      clipped-action clamp of torch_rl.frl.iql (action_eps 0.05);
#   3. THE HANDOVER PROTECTED, the lesson the k=8 run repeated: FRL_ACTOR_FREEZE=10000 decisions of
#      critic-only updates after start_training, so the critic re-fits on the run's own rows before it may
#      move the actor (unprotected, SAC took the clone off the expert within ~1,000 updates), and
#      FRL_RANDOM_START=0, so those rows come from the warm-started actor, not from uniform noise.
# NOT in this run: the small-CNN control stream (it does not carry heading: scripts/control_stream_heldout.py)
# and action repeat 8. One town because the 12 GB card holds one Epic server.
# KNOWN LIMIT: the expert rows carry the no_arrival cut, so the cloned actor has seen no braking at a goal;
# stopping has to come from the run's own experience, as it did in the 1.25M baseline.
_frl_steps=${FRL_MAX_STEPS:-150000}; _frl_ckpt=${FRL_CKPT_EVERY:-25000}; _frl_replay=${FRL_REPLAY:-150000}
_frl_freeze=${FRL_ACTOR_FREEZE:-10000}
. "$REPO/slurm/local_frl_c0emb_t01_ar2_xp.env"
export GOAL_ARRIVAL_MAX_SPEED=10
export FRL_IQL_PRETRAIN=${FRL_IQL_PRETRAIN:-30000}
export FRL_ACTOR_FREEZE=$_frl_freeze FRL_RANDOM_START=0
export FRL_MAX_STEPS=$_frl_steps FRL_CKPT_EVERY=$_frl_ckpt
export FRL_REPLAY=$_frl_replay FRL_REPLAY_DEVICE=${FRL_REPLAY_DEVICE:-cpu}
